u = (1^{n-1})$ is a column of length $n-1$, the symmetric function $\Delta'_{e_{n-1}} e_n$ appears in the Shuffle Theorem of Carlsson-Mellit. More generally, when $
u = (1^{k-1})$ is any column the polynomial $\Delta'_{e_{k-1}} e_n$ is the symmetric function side of the Delta Conjecture of Haglund-Remmel-Wilson. We give an expansion of $\omega \Delta'_{s_{
