u$. The Delta Conjecture at $t = 0$ was recently proven by Garsia-Haglund-Remmel-Yoo; our methods give a new proof of this result. We give an algebraic interpretation of $\omega \Delta'_{s_{
u}} e_n$ at $t = 0$ in terms of a $\mathrm{Hom}$-space.

